WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:04.202
Life returned to normal.

2
00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:07.404
The Battle of Toad Hall was over.

3
00:00:07.405 --> 00:00:11.033
And Toad's party was over.

4
00:00:11.034 --> 00:00:16.257
The four friends went back to their old lives.

5
00:00:16.258 --> 00:00:20.729
One day Rat was busy writing a poem.

6
00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:24.597
"What has Toad been doing?" he asked Mole.

7
00:00:24.598 --> 00:00:27.752
Mole was reading by the fire.

8
00:00:27.753 --> 00:00:33.298
"Toad bought the jailer's daughter a dress," he said.

9
00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.579
"Wow!" said Rat.

10
00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:39.750
"He gave her some pearls too," said Mole.

11
00:00:39.751 --> 00:00:43.950
"Well, she [i@did@i] help him escape," said Rat.

12
00:00:43.951 --> 00:00:49.367
Rat stretched his toes closer to the fire.

13
00:00:49.368 --> 00:00:53.632
"Toad wrote her a nice note too," said Mole.

14
00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:56.197
"He did?" asked Rat.

15
00:00:56.198 --> 00:01:00.902
"Yes, he said he was very thankful," said Mole.

16
00:01:00.903 --> 00:01:05.308
Rat stared into the fire, thinking.

17
00:01:05.309 --> 00:01:09.769
"Did he pay the train engineer too?" asked Rat.

18
00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:14.175
"Yes. He even paid the possum!" said Mole.

19
00:01:14.176 --> 00:01:18.476
"And he told her he was sorry."

20
00:01:18.477 --> 00:01:22.436
"That's good," laughed Rat.

21
00:01:22.437 --> 00:01:26.221
"He really has changed," said Mole.

22
00:01:26.222 --> 00:01:29.808
"He's a whole new Toad!"

23
00:01:29.809 --> 00:01:34.129
"Well," said Rat, "Badger was right.

24
00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:38.116
It was time for Toad to change."

25
00:01:38.117 --> 00:01:41.276
"I miss Badger," said Mole.

26
00:01:41.277 --> 00:01:44.102
"Have you seen him?"

27
00:01:44.103 --> 00:01:47.976
"You know how he is, Mole," said Rat.

28
00:01:47.977 --> 00:01:50.931
"He went back to the Wild Wood."

29
00:01:50.932 --> 00:01:54.417
"I hope we see him soon," said Mole.

30
00:01:54.418 --> 00:01:59.887
"He will visit when he's ready," said Rat.

